  dialogueIntro:
  - "I am Sir 1, sworn 2 of the realm. I have fought many battles and faced countless
    foes, but now I require a new 3\u2014one worthy of my station and my duty."
  - "Oi merchant! Name\u2019s 1. You\u2019ve probably heard it whispered around these
    parts. I'm in need of a 3, need it quick and cheap."
  dialogueAccept:
  - "Good. I\u2019ve heard much of your work. The men in my company speak highly
    of you. "
  - "Good lad. I\u2019ve heard you\u2019re the best around here, and I don\u2019t
    settle for anything less than the best. "
  dialogueRefuse:
  - Alas, I might have expected more from a merchant around these parts, nevertheless
    I beg thee farewell.
  - There are not many that refuse me, and those that do, don't tend to live very
    long around these parts...
  dialogueReturn:
  - Oi merchant, I have returned for my 3, is it ready?
  - A
  dialogueComplete:
  - "Let me see it, then. Know that this 3 will see battle, and every time it is
    drawn, your craftsmanship will be tested\u2014and praised."
  - "Now this... This is what I\u2019m talkin\u2019 about! You earned your coin,
    ever damn last of em."
